<title>USA: Prudential wins $30 mln S. Carolina University.</title>
<headline>Prudential wins $30 mln S. Carolina University.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won a $30 million South Carolina state institution bond issue, Series 1996B, sold on behalf of the University of South Carolina, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.217 percent.</p>
</text>
